pro_course_detail.description:
This lesson is perfect for those students who want to practice and improve their speaking skills.

What can you gain from this class? Well, just speaking and talking! 

Depending on the student, you can expect:

✦ Relaxed and flowy conversations;
✦ Conversations with purpose about your interest topics;
✦ Discussing articles or videos about engaging subjects;
✦ Discussing debate questions or hypothetical scenarios.

Whatever grammar-related questions or any other questions you may have, you can ask them and I will make sure to help you in any way I can. 😃
